Package: rviuer
Title: R binding to viuer
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Yuxi", "Yang", , "15364051195@163.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: rviuer draws images, including plots captured straight from R, in the
    terminal. It uses the iTerm, Kitty or Sixel graphics protocols when the
    terminal supports them, and falls back to coloured half-blocks otherwise.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Suggests: 
    ggplot2,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports: 
    cli,
    png,
    ragg,
    rlang
URL: https://exceret.github.io/rviuer/, https://github.com/Exceret/rviuer
BugReports: https://github.com/Exceret/rviuer/issues
Depends: 
    R (>= 4.2)
Config/rextendr/version: 0.5.0
SystemRequirements: Cargo (Rust's package manager), rustc >= 1.65.0, xz
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
